<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="9d9cd2ed">&lt;p&gt;
    To store definitions of data systems in order to support initiatives such as data sourcing, code development, data
    integration, analytics and reporting.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="impactOfNotHaving" nodeId="12032057"></attribute>
<attribute name="reasonsForNotNeeding" nodeId="57e248c7"></attribute>
<attribute name="briefOutline" nodeId="465382c7">&lt;p&gt;
    The following information is typically captured while defining a data system:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Name
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Type
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Instances
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Location
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Availability - lead time (days after period end), logic check table or feed, etc.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Attributes
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Filtering rules
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Validation rules
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Checksums
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Ranges&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
